  "label": "Racist Analogical Mapping: Using a rusty funnel to symbolize Black people as 'anthing that doesn't belong to them'",
  "description": "The meme uses the visual of a rusty, worn-out funnel as a metaphor to imply that Black people are undeserving of certain things or are being denied access to them. This is a racist trope that reduces a racial group to a metaphorical object of exclusion and dispossession.",
